# Prettier owns the frontend source and its configuration. Everything below is owned by something
# else, and letting the formatter reach into it produces churn at best and broken artifacts at
# worst — a first run over the whole repository rewrote 34 files of unrelated work.

node_modules
dist
target/
**/target/
package-lock.json

# Rust, formatted by `cargo fmt`. Its JSON configuration is hand-maintained alongside it, and
# `capabilities/*.json` in particular is read by reviewers as a security surface.
src-tauri/

# Cross-language contract vectors, compared byte for byte by both languages so they pin key order
# as well as key names (fixtures/transport/README.md). Reformatting them rewrites the authority
# both suites are checked against.
fixtures/

# Spike harnesses are reference implementations to mine, not production code (AGENTS.md), and
# their record JSONs are reproducibility artifacts each spike's `verify` binary recomputes.
tools/

# Design documents. Prose line-wrapping is deliberate and reviewed; a formatter rewrapping it
# makes every future diff unreadable.
docs/
*.md

# Generated by @tanstack/router-plugin on every dev and build run.
src/routeTree.gen.ts
